  "en": {
    "slug": "stock-cpa-and-consent-based-leads-at-jcurve",
    "title": "Stock CPA and consented leads at J-Curve",
    "excerpt": "J-Curve describes its stock-investor targeting, consent-based calls and approach to lead quality and volume.",
    "content": "<p style=\"line-height:2;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">﻿</span></p><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b></b></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b></b></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>J-Curve Interactive, an advertising agency specializing in stock CPA and consented-lead marketing</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">, is here to help.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Quasi-investment-advisory businesses and firms dealing in unlisted stocks may use CPA and consented-lead providers to acquire quality prospects. In fact, </span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>stock CPA and consented-lead marketing</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> require </span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>improvements in both volume and quality, </b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">which makes them difficult to approach.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-left se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-image __se-unit se-is-selected\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTBfMjI2/MDAxNjA0OTk1OTU3MTc5.wk4sMVykYcTGiWTAvzB8OM6NzWVLnwqahO5qLLGZzXQg.tymGw_VIQQSjjzIO4QMmOnF10IahSRAFBZxi8h6_mjkg.PNG.j-curve/CPA_%EA%B4%91%EA%B3%A0%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_(4).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> However, ordinary CPA providers use </span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>hooking or clickbait ads</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> to collect and deliver leads, </span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>resulting in poor quality.</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Permission-lead providers also</span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b> reuse the original leads repeatedly, reducing quality.</b></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> In CPA,</span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><b> lower prices and lead quality move in opposite directions,</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> so understand the trade-off before commissioning work. J-Curve Interactive's CPA and consented leads address these concerns. We will explain ways to improve both quality and volume.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">﻿<span></span></span></p><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-left se-is-selected se-is-activated\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-image __se-unit se-is-activated\"><div class=\"se-resize-guide-box\" style=\"width:886px;height:886px;\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTBfMjc0/MDAxNjA0OTk1OTY3NDMx.uYIhpWd3wXmgO5OZS3uqnLVzQBzH8HtolUzk5WJWD44g.1CYmUXbl6sWzJOz80v7lX04x7kdh_U4vHrW8RvuG524g.PNG.j-curve/CPA_%EA%B4%91%EA%B3%A0%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_(3).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"><div class=\"se-resizer se-resizer-top-left\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> </span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_line\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_line se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b> Strong targeting: ads shown only to people interested in stocks</b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Our targeting tools selectively show ads to interested people. CPC and CPM are higher than ordinary ads, requiring a larger initial budget, but conversion rates and customer response are stronger. Investment-advisory advertisers therefore keep renewing.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> We combine device-based targeting with our own solution, tracking analytics across media to build refined audiences. This is a trade secret, so we cannot explain details even on request. We also maximize lead quality through traditional creative-based demarketing.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_line\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_line se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b> Consent-based leads from people with recent interest</b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> We provide consented leads from people currently investing in stocks or recently interested in them. Rather than old, indiscriminately collected or unlawfully obtained information, we use information customers submitted legitimately and collect it in compliance with personal-information protection law before consent calls, making the results different.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> We do not call indiscriminately. Only leads passing questions and checks for genuine investment interest proceed, and scripts are continuously updated to maintain quality.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Daily capacity is limited, so we cannot serve many advertisers. Capacity is currently full and new advertisers cannot be accepted. If an existing advertiser does not renew, the next waiting advertiser takes the inventory. Pricing and volume are therefore more constrained than ordinary stock CPA.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTBfNzMg/MDAxNjA0OTk1OTc5MjE1.tEfR1Il2QMKeAdsMEuWcpREdFpTTg3eK0856mT0unMog.HtQkZ707HlXgF83cv699nehVZPwK83Fqn76p_hx_5rQg.PNG.j-curve/CPA_%EA%B4%91%EA%B3%A0%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_(5).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"><br></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"> </p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-default se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><blockquote class=\"se2_quote2\" style='margin:0 0 30px 13px;padding:0 8px 0 16px;background:url(\"http://static.se2.naver.com/static/img/bg_quote2.gif\") no-repeat 0 3px;color:#888888;'><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanummyeongjo se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><i><b> J-Curve Interactive applies performance-marketing expertise to CPA</b></i></span></p></blockquote></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"> We are a performance-marketing agency. That is why we cannot help but be good at CPA, which sits at the sharp end of delivering results. We have particularly varied references in stocks.<br><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> As an early marketer for quasi-investment-advisory businesses, we handled Hwiyeol's Leading Stocks Investment Club and Cheonggaeguri Investment Club, later working with Han Yong-hee Investment Club, Wall Street Korea, X1, Yeouido TV, Galaxy Investment Group, Cheongin Invest and Isang Investment.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> If you handle stock-investment advertising or quasi-investment-advisory marketing,</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> contact </span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>J-Curve Interactive</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> today.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> We will discuss your needs carefully.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><p style=\"line-height:2;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">﻿</span> </p>",
    "meta_title": "Stock CPA and consented leads at J-Curve",
    "meta_description": "J-Curve describes its stock-investor targeting, consent-based calls and approach to lead quality and volume."
  },
  "ja": {
    "slug": "stock-cpa-and-consent-based-leads-at-jcurve",
    "title": "J-Curveの株式CPAと同意取得済みリード",
    "excerpt": "株式投資家へのターゲティング、同意取得済みのコール、リードの質と量への取り組みを紹介します。",
    "content": "<p style=\"line-height:2;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">﻿</span></p><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b></b></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b></b></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>株式CPAと同意取得済みリードの広告代理店、J-Curve Interactive</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">です。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">類似投資助言業者や未上場株式の取扱業者などでは、良質なリードを確保するため、さまざまなCPA会社や同意取得済みリードの提供会社と契約して広告を行っていることでしょう。実際、 </span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>株式CPAと同意取得済みリードのマーケティング</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">では、 </span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>量と質の両方を高める必要が </b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">あるため、簡単には取り組めません。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-left se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-image __se-unit se-is-selected\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTBfMjI2/MDAxNjA0OTk1OTU3MTc5.wk4sMVykYcTGiWTAvzB8OM6NzWVLnwqahO5qLLGZzXQg.tymGw_VIQQSjjzIO4QMmOnF10IahSRAFBZxi8h6_mjkg.PNG.j-curve/CPA_%EA%B4%91%EA%B3%A0%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_(4).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">しかし一般のCPA会社では、 </span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>フック、つまり釣り広告</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">でリードだけを取得して広告主に渡すため、 </span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>質が低くなります。</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">同意取得済みリードの提供会社でも、元となる</span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>リードを何度も使い回すため、品質が落ちます。</b></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">CPAでは、</span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><b>価格の低さとリード品質は相反するため、</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">依頼前に理解することが大切です。当社はその悩みを踏まえ、質と量を両立する方法を案内します。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">﻿<span></span></span></p><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-left se-is-selected se-is-activated\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-image __se-unit se-is-activated\"><div class=\"se-resize-guide-box\" style=\"width:886px;height:886px;\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTBfMjc0/MDAxNjA0OTk1OTY3NDMx.uYIhpWd3wXmgO5OZS3uqnLVzQBzH8HtolUzk5WJWD44g.1CYmUXbl6sWzJOz80v7lX04x7kdh_U4vHrW8RvuG524g.PNG.j-curve/CPA_%EA%B4%91%EA%B3%A0%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_(3).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"><div class=\"se-resizer se-resizer-top-left\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> </span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_line\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_line se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b>強力なターゲティング：株式に関心がある人だけに表示する広告運用</b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">当社は強力なターゲティングツールを保有し、関心のある顧客だけに広告を選んで配信しています。この方式は一般的な広告よりCPCやCPMが高いため、初期の広告費が多くかかるという短所はありますが、その分コンバージョン率と顧客の反応が高く、投資助言業の広告主の皆様に継続して契約を更新いただいています。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">この方式では、端末ベースのターゲティングに加え、J-Curve Interactiveが独自に開発したソリューションで複数媒体の分析値を追跡し、精度の高いターゲットを作り上げていきます。（この方法は営業秘密のため、お問い合わせいただいても回答できませんので、ご了承ください。）さらに、従来型のターゲティング手法であるクリエイティブを使ったデマーケティング型の広告運用で、リードの品質を最大限に高めています。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_line\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_line se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b>最近の関心層から得る同意取得済みリード</b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">当社は、現在株式に投資している、または最近株式に関心を持った顧客を対象に、同意取得済みリードを提供しています。古いリードや、いわゆる「質の悪いリード」と呼ばれる無差別に集めたリード、個人情報保護法に違反するリードではなく、顧客本人が正規に残し、個人情報保護法を守って合法的に取得したリードで同意確認の電話を行うため、効果に違いが出ます。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">また、この同意取得済みリードでは、やみくもに電話をかけるのではなく、株式投資の意向確認とアンケートを通過したリードにだけ電話を進めています。トークスクリプトも継続的に更新しているため、品質に優れています。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">一日に対応できる数量に限りがあり、多数の広告主には提供できません。現在は枠が埋まり、新規受付はできません。更新しない広告主が出ると次の待機者が枠を取るため、価格と数量は通常の株式CPAより限定的です。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTBfNzMg/MDAxNjA0OTk1OTc5MjE1.tEfR1Il2QMKeAdsMEuWcpREdFpTTg3eK0856mT0unMog.HtQkZ707HlXgF83cv699nehVZPwK83Fqn76p_hx_5rQg.PNG.j-curve/CPA_%EA%B4%91%EA%B3%A0%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_(5).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"><br></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"> </p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-default se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><blockquote class=\"se2_quote2\" style='margin:0 0 30px 13px;padding:0 8px 0 16px;background:url(\"http://static.se2.naver.com/static/img/bg_quote2.gif\") no-repeat 0 3px;color:#888888;'><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanummyeongjo se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><i><b>パフォーマンスマーケティングの実力でCPAを極めるJ-Curve Interactive</b></i></span></p></blockquote></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\">当社はパフォーマンスマーケティングの代理店です。だからこそ、CPAが得意でないはずがありません。CPAこそ、成果を出す仕事の頂点にあるからです。特に株式では幅広い事例があります。<br><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">当社は類似投資助言業者向けマーケティングの第一世代として、早くからHwiyeol's Leading Stocks Investment Club、Cheonggaeguri Investment Clubなどの広告代行を担当し、その後もHan Yong-hee Investment Club、Wall Street Korea、X1、Yeouido TV、Galaxy Investment Group、Cheongin Invest、Isang Investmentなど、さまざまな業者の広告代行を手がけてきました。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">株式投資広告や類似投資助言業の担当者の方は、</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">ぜひ当社 </span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><b>J-Curve Interactive</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">へご相談ください。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs16 __se-node\">丁寧にお話を伺います。</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><p style=\"line-height:2;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">﻿</span> </p>",
    "meta_title": "J-Curveの株式CPAと同意取得済みリード",
    "meta_description": "株式投資家へのターゲティング、同意取得済みのコール、リードの質と量への取り組みを紹介します。"
  }
}
